"is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "1", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA4kCPOeByqCgjR2kQNJe7XxBPvflg0fPnClWJqjxc3P4", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA4kCPOeByqCgjR2kQNJe7XxBPvflg0fPnClWJqjxc3P4", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "2243667965", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "微笑yy", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_9647758278284045affd2da76da581c9.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419541536}, {"comment_id": "7615232929145783077", "create_time": 1773059587, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7614160456671857926", "content": "作为延边人，看完这个视频真的很有感触。视频里把朝鲜族舞蹈和丹顶鹤的姿态融合得太妙了，咱延边的朝鲜族舞蹈就是这样，从生活里来，从自然里来，每一个动作都带着咱们民族的根儿。看到舞者去观察鹤、模仿鹤，再把这种灵动融入舞蹈，就像看到了咱们祖辈把耕地、劳作的姿态变成舞蹈语言一样，这才是咱朝鲜族舞蹈的魂啊！希望这样的作品能让更多人看到，了解咱们延边朝鲜族文化的独特魅力。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "19", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAATnOJvHriPlzHL3Ji1RgoUooNIwseJfYIz4klo4AN0C0", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAATnOJvHriPlzHL3Ji1RgoUooNIwseJfYIz4klo4AN0C0", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1696349969", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "群山", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/mosaic-legacy_fcb00004b55a1b55fecc.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419541536}, {"comment_id": "7615161307252163364", "create_time": 1773042912, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7614160456671857926", "content": "李英花老师@“朝鲜族鹤舞”传承人— 英花🦩", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "1", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA06YTLWfFejjj3qgXFlPwimpGhS_2HEw2pr9lTVFoCgM", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA06YTLWfFejjj3qgXFlPwimpGhS_2HEw2pr9lTVFoCgM", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "131240436", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "娇", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_87af08b78f7fc11502dd810bd0810f0c.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419541536}, {"comment_id": "7615228949803451174", "create_time": 1773058661, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7614160456671857926", "content": "原来朝鲜族舞的灵感是仙鹤，这飘逸感真的模仿不来[笑哭]。瞬间对延边长草了，列入旅行清单！[耶]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "35", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAIC-_nlBo_jlY17n31CWmzDYSlGWK8u5XjlzQ7m4edwE", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAIC-_nlBo_jlY17n31CWmzDYSlGWK8u5XjlzQ7m4edwE", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "134210397", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "在苍茫的大盆上", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oQAFULEgC6AFwEjOBt9veRftAlDKACAIIAUqsG.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2", "last_modify_ts": 1794419541536}, {"comment_id": "7615230382543766324", "create_time": 1773058993, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7614160456671857926", "content": "鹤舞安图，江映延边\n非遗传韵，山水藏诗\n吉林延边州，邀您共赏边境风华", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "28", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAlUY5Vt0c14anwFUTLIt8QvtgUAz2szwG2UJMJVItTdU", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAlUY5Vt0c14anwFUTLIt8QvtgUAz2szwG2UJMJVItTdU", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "Zhongguoren8833", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "ෆ 南木ᐝ", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_fe659beb61cc03c7ac768a906a612e0c.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419541536}, {"comment_id": "7615448919951196954", "create_time": 1773109876, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7614160456671857926", "content": "朝鲜族舞的灵魂，确实是从鹤那里“偷”来的。不是模仿鹤的姿态，而是修炼鹤的呼吸。所以你看真正的舞者，手臂延展不是在用力，而是在“飘”，脚下辗转不是在移动，而是在“踏云”。他们追求的不是像鹤，而是让身体成为鹤，那是朝鲜族文化里最极致的仙气与洁净。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "28", "user_id": "MS4wLjAB